Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|false|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Reports|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Report Invalid Email
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And these variables
		|key_reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
	And Click at locator 'ReportsAdmin#DEFINITIONS_DEFINITION_TABLE_ACTIONS'
	And AssertClick the value 'Add Report' at locator 'ReportsAdmin#DEFINITIONS_DEFINITION_MENULIST_ADD_REPORT'
	And Select the value 'csv' at locator 'ReportsAdminEditReportEntry#REPORT_FORMAT_SELECT'
	And Type the value 'InvalidEmail' at locator 'ReportsAdminEditReportEntry#EMAIL_NOTIFICATIONS_FIELD'
	And AssertClick the value 'Generate' at locator 'ReportsAdminEditReportEntry#GENERATE_BUTTON'
	And Alert view Request Failed To Complete
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'Please enter a valid email address.' at locator 'Message#ERROR_2'
	And Type the value 'liferay.qa1@gmail.com' at locator 'ReportsAdminEditReportEntry#EMAIL_NOTIFICATIONS_FIELD'
	And Type the value 'InvalidEmail' at locator 'ReportsAdminEditReportEntry#EMAIL_RECIPIENT_FIELD'
	And AssertClick the value 'Generate' at locator 'ReportsAdminEditReportEntry#GENERATE_BUTTON'
	And Alert view Request Failed To Complete
	Then AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'Please enter a valid email address.' at locator 'Message#ERROR_2'
Scenario: Add Schedule
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And ReportsAdmin add Schedule Entry
		|emailNotificationsAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|emailRecipientAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|reportFormat|pdf|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
	And ReportsAdmin view Report Entry
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
	And ReportsAdmin view No Report Entry File
		|reportsFileName|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Processing report. This may take several minutes.' at locator 'ReportsAdminViewReportEntry#INFO_MESSAGE'
	And Pause at locator '180000'
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	And ReportsAdmin view Report Entry
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
	Then ReportsAdmin view Report Entry Fields
		|dataSource|portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
		|reportsFileName|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name|
		|scheduled|true|
		|userName|Test Test|
