Scenario: Test Database Connection
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these variables
		|databasePassword|TestPropsUtil#get('database.mysql.password')|
	And these variables
		|databaseURL|TestPropsUtil#get('database.mysql.url')|
	And these variables
		|databaseUsername|TestPropsUtil#get('database.mysql.username')|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Sources
	And ReportsAdmin add Source
		|reportsDataSourceClass|com.mysql.jdbc.Driver|
		|reportsDataSourceName|Reports Data Source Name|
		|reportsDataSourcePassword|${databasePassword}|
		|reportsDataSourceURL|${databaseURL}|
		|reportsDataSourceUser|${databaseUsername}|
	And ReportsAdmin test Database Connection
	Then PortletEntry save
Scenario: View Email Notification Delivery
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.assert.javascript.errors|false|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPReportsadmin#ViewEmailNotificationDelivery|
	And these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And TestCase get Site Name
##########################################################
The Poshi return element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration configure Mail Server Settings
		|userName|TestPropsUtil#get('email.address.1')|
		|userPassword|TestPropsUtil#get('email.password.1')|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Entry
		|emailNotificationsAddress|TestPropsUtil#get('email.address.2')|
		|emailRecipientAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|reportFormat|pdf|
		|reportName|Custom Report Name|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
	And Pause at locator '30000'
	And Gmail login
		|userEmailAddress|TestPropsUtil#get('email.address.2')|
		|userPassword|TestPropsUtil#get('email.password.2')|
	And Gmail goto Html Mode
	And Gmail view Mail
		|emailFromUserName|Joe Bloggs|
		|gmailAssetType|New Report: Custom Report Name.pdf|
		|gmailMessageBody|You have a new report.|
		|gmailMessageTitle|New Report: Custom Report Name.pdf|
	And these variables
		|key_gmailAssetType|New Report: Custom Report Name.pdf|
	And these variables
		|key_pageNameURL|report|
	And AssertClick assert Partial Text Click At the value 'report' at locator 'Gmail#GMAIL_HTML_MODE_MESSAGE_BODY_LINK'
	And Pause at locator '30000'
	And SelectWindow at locator 'title=Reports Definition Name - ${siteName}'
	And ReportsAdmin view Report Entry Fields
		|dataSource|portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
		|reportsFileName|Custom Report Name.pdf|
		|userName|Test Test|
	And Gmail goto Html Mode
	And Gmail delete Specific Mail
		|gmailMessageTitleList|New Report: Custom Report Name.pdf,Your New Account,Your New Password|
	Then Open at locator '${portalURL}'
